{"id": "EUVD-2026-87659", "enisaUuid": "78f74ec6-6572-34db-a32a-ed2b173e0b67", "description": "Budibase versions before 3.45.0 fail to validate per-app authorization in the POST /api/global/groups/:groupId/apps endpoint, allowing builders to assign application roles across workspace boundaries. A builder of a single workspace can exploit missing per-app authorization checks to grant themselves admin roles in other workspaces by modifying user group role mappings.", "datePublished": "2026-09-26T13:23:46", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:21:57", "baseScore": 8.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/security/advisories/GHSA-pp5r-q4fp-mcj3", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/budibase-before-3.45.0-cross-workspace-privilege-escalation-via-post-api-global-groups-groupid-apps"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-100686", "GHSA-9mjc-4gf6-xhx7"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "481d6c9e-aedf-3bcd-969a-ad63f0a909e6", "product": {"name": "Server", "vendor": {"name": "Devolutions"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.45.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4218455f-8945-3333-b30b-06588a07d9c1", "vendor": {"name": "budibase"}}], "isExploited": false}